00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
2052 - GREENLAND

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:27,000
SYSTEM FAILURE / VIRUS DETECTED

3
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
PROJECT HORIZON
ADVENTURE AT THE HEART OF DIGITAL

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Technician: Okay, we're rolling, you can go.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Swann: Welcome to the Data Palace! Swann and Ismail here.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:45,000
We are in charge of this data center, which was designed to store resource data important to scientists worldwide.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Ismail: So, if you're seeing this message, it's because we actually need your help.

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Uh, there was a major cyberattack a few hours ago, and it has disrupted many of the data center's systems.

9
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Swann: We are going to leave to fix the center's network manager systems,

10
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:05,000
but we need all the skills and intelligence of IT specialists like you to fix all the other systems.

11
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Swann: By the way Hal, can you give us the list of problems?

12
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:11,000
HAL: According to the diagnostic system, several servers are close to overheating.

13
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,000
They must be cooled down urgently.

14
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,000
HAL: A blockage has been detected in ventilation duct 25B.

15
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:21,000
It must be removed as quickly as possible to reactivate the cooling systems.

16
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Ismail: As you can see, there is a lot to do.

17
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:28,000
But don't hesitate to refer to the envelope you were given.

18
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:31,000
And if you need help, ask one of the technicians accompanying you.

19
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Swann: You will need to work together to overcome the challenges that await you.

20
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:36,000
So don't hesitate to stick together.

21
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Ismail: Thank you for your help and good luck to everyone!